IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. WAGECALC.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-HOURS        PIC 9(3)V9  VALUE 0.
01 WS-RATE         PIC 9(3)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-GROSS        PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-OVERTIME     PIC 9(3)V9  VALUE 0.
01 WS-TAX          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
01 WS-NET          PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    ACCEPT WS-HOURS
    ACCEPT WS-RATE
    IF WS-HOURS > 40
        SUBTRACT 40 FROM WS-HOURS GIVING WS-OVERTIME
        COMPUTE WS-GROSS = 40 * WS-RATE + WS-OVERTIME * WS-RATE * 1.5
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-GROSS = WS-HOURS * WS-RATE
    END-IF
    IF WS-GROSS > 3000
        COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-GROSS * 0.28
    ELSE
        COMPUTE WS-TAX = WS-GROSS * 0.15
    END-IF
    SUBTRACT WS-TAX FROM WS-GROSS GIVING WS-NET
    DISPLAY 'NET PAY: ' WS-NET
    STOP RUN.
